  "card": "This pull request adds an optional control_block_warnings field to decodepsbt to flag Taproot leaf control blocks that fail structural validation checks. Currently, decodepsbt displays leaf script records as-is, and InferTaprootTree silently ignores invalid candidates when reconstructing the tree, providing no indication to developers or users that a leaf is unusable. The change extracts the existing four checks from InferTaprootTree into a shared helper to report issues like invalid leaf versions, wrong control block lengths, or mismatched Merkle roots without altering signing behavior. It has no open dependencies.",
